OL,3,C'A horrific act of terror': Settlers
OL,4,Csiege Palestinian homes in the West
OL,5,CBank
OL,7,FIsraeli settlers have sieged
OL,8,FPalestinian homes in the West Bank in
OL,9,Fwhat the US ambassador described as a
OL,10,F"horrific act of terror".
OL,12,FLocal officials and family members
OL,13,Fsaid a group of settlers, including up
OL,14,Fto dozens of men, have gathered
OL,15,Foutside the home in village of Qusra
OL,16,Fsince Sunday and harassed those
OL,17,Finside, despite efforts by the Israeli
OL,18,Fmilitary to defuse the situation.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786709907
OL,3,C'A horrific act of terror': Settlers
OL,4,Csiege Palestinian homes in the West
OL,5,CBank
OL,7,FMen have thrown stones, attempted to
OL,8,Fbring down a stone wall nearby, and
OL,9,Fprevented the occupants from leaving
OL,10,Fdespite dwindling supplies.
OL,12,FLou Ridi, an American-Palestinian who
OL,13,Fowns the building, spoke to the
OL,14,FAssociated Press about the ordeal from
OL,15,Fhis home Ohio.
OL,17,FHe said his brother and nephew, who
OL,18,Fhave been holed up in the home to
OL,19,Fdefend it, had been unable to leave
OL,20,Fthe house and did not have access to
OL,21,Ffood or water for several days.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786709907
OL,3,C'A horrific act of terror': Settlers
OL,4,Csiege Palestinian homes in the West
OL,5,CBank
OL,7,FOn Thursday morning, the owner's
OL,8,Fbrother Qusai Abu Rida said that he
OL,9,Fand his teenage son had been evacuated
OL,10,Fby the Israel Defence Forces (IDF).
OL,12,FIt was unclear what would happen to
OL,13,Fthe property and at least one other
OL,14,Fthat has been targeted.
OL,16,FIn a post on social media platform X,
OL,17,FUS Ambassador to Israel Mike Huckabee
OL,18,Fsaid there is "no excuse for such
OL,19,Fthuggish behavior".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786709907
OL,3,C'A horrific act of terror': Settlers
OL,4,Csiege Palestinian homes in the West
OL,5,CBank
OL,7,FHe added: "Actions by those who
OL,8,Fcarried out this horrific act of
OL,9,Fterror meant to intimidate and harass
OL,10,Fthis family are disgusting."
OL,12,FIsraeli troops had intervened to try
OL,13,Fand restore order in recent days.
OL,15,FThe military said they dismantled "two
OL,16,Fillegal outposts" on the outskirts of
OL,17,FQusra and a nearby village overnight
OL,18,Fon Thursday, and detained one Israeli.
OL,26,@wD@cOUxD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
