FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786709907
OL,3,C'A horrific act of terror': Settlers
OL,4,Csiege Palestinian homes in the West
OL,5,CBank
OL,7,FIt added that additional soldiers had
OL,8,Fsurged to the area to "carry out
OL,9,Fdefensive missions and patrols".
OL,11,FHome security footage from Thursday
OL,12,Fmorning appeared to show a few
OL,13,Fsettlers still hiding by a damaged
OL,14,Fstone wall near the house.
OL,16,FJournalists on the outskirts of Qusra,
OL,17,Fwhich is south of the city of Nablus,
OL,18,Fsaid roads into the village were
OL,19,Fclosed.
OL,26,@pD@WOUqD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786709907
OL,3,C'A horrific act of terror': Settlers
OL,4,Csiege Palestinian homes in the West
OL,5,CBank
OL,7,FIsraeli police did not immediately
OL,8,Frespond to questions about whether any
OL,9,FIsraeli civilians had been arrested.
OL,11,FRidi said settlers have been harassing
OL,12,Fhis home for months before the
OL,13,Fsituation escalated in recent days.
OL,15,FHe said they had cut off the water and
OL,16,Felectricity to his house and thrown
OL,17,Fstones, causing damage to the property
OL,18,Fas well as at least one more house in
OL,19,Fthe area.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786709907
OL,3,C'A horrific act of terror': Settlers
OL,4,Csiege Palestinian homes in the West
OL,5,CBank
OL,7,F"We are prisoners in our own house,
OL,8,Fhostages in our own house," Ridi said.
OL,10,FClashes between settlers and
OL,11,FPalestinians have surged in the last
OL,12,Ffew years.
OL,14,FPalestinians and the Israeli political
OL,15,Fopposition have accused Prime Minister
OL,16,FBenjamin Netanyahu's government of
OL,17,Fturning a blind eye to attacks.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
