FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786709907
OL,3,C'A horrific act of terror': Settlers
OL,4,Csiege Palestinian homes in the West
OL,5,CBank
OL,7,FIn July a mosque in Qusra was set on
OL,8,Ffire in another apparent settler
OL,9,Fattack. That followed the killing of
OL,10,Fan Israeli settler, which triggered
OL,11,Fviolence that left two Israeli
OL,12,Fsoldiers and four Palestinian
OL,13,Fvillagers dead.
OL,15,FSettlers have been building more
OL,16,Foutposts in an attempt to dismantle
OL,17,Fhopes of establishing a Palestinian
OL,18,Fstate in the occupied West Bank.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
