PN,31309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786709907
OL,3,C'A horrific act of terror': Settlers
OL,4,Csiege Palestinian homes in the West
OL,5,CBank
OL,7,FThe Palestinians seek the West Bank,
OL,8,Fcaptured by Israel in the 1967 war, as
OL,9,Fpart of a future state.
OL,11,FMany settlers and their supporters say
OL,12,Fthe entire area should belong to
OL,13,FIsrael for historical, religious and
OL,14,Fsecurity reasons.
OL,16,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,17,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,18,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,19,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
